==Icelandic==
===Etymology===
From the verb ''[[leggja]]'' (meaning to "[[lay]]") + ''[[á#Icelandic|á]]'' (meaning "[[on]]") + ''[[minnið]]'' (meaning "the [[memory]]"), the {{indef}} {{acc}} {{singular}} of ''[[minni]]'' (meaning "[[memory]]"). Literally meaning to "lay on the memory".
===Noun===
'''[[leggja]] [[á#Icelandic|á]] [[minni#Icelandic|minnið]]'''

# to [[keep]] in [[mind]], to [[study]]

[[Category:Icelandic verbs]]

[[is:leggja á minnið]]